"cli.help" = "Cairn — storage analysis, backups and git maintenance for your Mac.\n\nUsage: cairn <command> [options]\n\nCommands:\n  analyze [folder…]   Analyze disk usage of folders\n  ai                  List AI tools and what is backed up\n  backup [--dry-run]  Back up to the configured destinations\n  verify [--full]     Check backup integrity\n  restore [--apply]   Restore a backup (simulation by default)\n  git [--apply]       Clean up gone branches and stale worktrees\n  tools [--export D]  List CLI tools to reinstall\n  config <cmd>        Show or validate the configuration (path, show, validate)\n  version             Show the Cairn version\n  help                Show this help\n\nOptions:\n  --config <file>       Use another configuration file\n  --lang <en-US|fr-FR>  Language for this run\n  -h, --help            Show help";
